flowchart TD
    accTitle: Login disclosure and protected audit flow
    accDescr: Different protected authentication causes produce one public invalid-credentials response while a stable reason remains available only to protected audit processing.

    Request["Login request"] --> Cause["Protected causes: unknown identity, wrong password, locked or disabled, restricted account"]
    Cause --> Public["401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS"]
    Cause --> Audit["Stable protected audit reason"]
